# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:2
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_1df70267:

    # "Whilst making my way through some meadows, I stumbled upon some deer grazing upon the grass."
    "Whilst fazendo meu way through some meadows, Eu stumbled upon some deer grazing upon the grass."

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:5
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_b632c376:

    # "The thought crossed my mind that their hide and meat could prove valuable... {i}If we can catch them before they bolt.{/i}"
    "The pensou crossed meu mind aquilo deles hide and meat poderia prove valuable... {i}If nós pode catch eles before eles bolt.{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:10
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_783b92c5:

    # "As I drew closer, I tried using one of my tentacles to spring and strike at the deer quickly!"
    "As Eu drew closer, Eu tentou using one of meu tentáculos to spring and strike at the deer quickly!"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:11
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_76af3f6a:

    # "Rushing out to protect its mate, a stag came charging out, stood between me and my prize..."
    "Rushing out to protect seu mate, a stag veio charging out, ficou between mim and meu prize..."

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:17
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_69e9c81c:

    # "As the stag fell, the doe had long since sprinted off..."
    "As the stag caiu, the doe tinha longo since sprinted off..."

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:18
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_2c1ec83b:

    # "Still though, the stag's hide and meat would prove worthwhile in itself."
    "Still though, the stag's hide and meat iria prove worthwhile in se."

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:20
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_783b92c5_1:

    # "As I drew closer, I tried using one of my tentacles to spring and strike at the deer quickly!"
    "As Eu drew closer, Eu tentou using one of meu tentáculos to spring and strike at the deer quickly!"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:21
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_39c082ad:

    # "As the tentacle pierced the soft, warm, flesh, the doe yelped in pain as the others fled."
    "As the tentáculo pierced the macio, morno, flesh, the doe yelped in pain as the others fled."

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:23
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_82dab113:

    # "The doe quickly collapsed to the floor, shaking briefly before I put the thing out of it's misery with a quick blow."
    "The doe quickly collapsed to the floor, sacudindo briefly before Eu colocar the thing out of isso de misery with a rápido blow."

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:24
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_0a2fa116:

    # "As the red, warm blood pooled, I pulled out a small knife and began to skin my prize..."
    "As the red, morno blood pooled, Eu puxou out a pequeno knife and começou to pele meu prize..."

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:28
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_1b79797c:

    # "I drew closer towards them, ready to strike with a tentacle I planned to spring from my palm like a spear."
    "Eu drew closer towards eles, pronto to strike with a tentáculo Eu planned to spring from meu palm gostar a spear."

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:29
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_90807d48:

    # "Unfortunately, after feeling a fallen branch snap beneath my feet, the spooked deer bolted before I could make my move."
    "Unfortunately, after sentindo a fallen branch snap beneath meu pés, the spooked deer bolted before Eu poderia fazer meu mover."

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:32
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_cc57066b:

    # MC "(Damn!)"
    MC "(Droga!)"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:33
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_d27fcd00:

    # MC "(Perhaps next time...)"
    MC "(Talvez na próxima vez...)"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:35
translate ptBR travel_event_deer_e4800ca4:

    # "Deciding to leave the deer alone, I simply walked on by and continue to let them continue grazing in peace."
    "Decidindo deixar os cervos em paz, simplesmente passei e os deixei continuar pastando tranquilamente."

